Configurable jump distance and jump height multipliers for Gothic 1, Gothic 1 Classic, Gothic 2 Classic, and Gothic 2: Night of the Raven (including The Chronicles of Myrtana: Archolos, Nostalgic Edition, Returning, and other overhaul mods).

Allows you to customize the horizontal distance of running jumps, acrobatics jumps, standing jumps, as well as the jump height.

[b]Features:[/b]
- Independent multipliers for running forward jumps, acrobatics jumps, and standing vertical jumps.
- Master horizontal distance multiplier ([b]JumpMultiplier[/b]) to quickly scale all jumps proportionally (e.g. to match movement speedup mods like [b]zSpeedyAnis[/b]).
- Jump height / vertical impulse multiplier ([b]JumpHeightMultiplier[/b]).
- Built-in FPS-independent jump distance stabilization.
- Fully compatible with [b]Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps[/b] (scales on top if installed, or works standalone).
- Multi-engine support: G1, G1A, G2, G2A.
- 100% Standalone Union plugin.

[b]Configuration (Gothic.ini):[/b]
[code]
[ZJUMPDISTANCE]
; master multiplier for all jumps (horizontal distance)
JumpMultiplier=1.0
; multiplier for normal running and standing forward jump
JumpForwardMultiplier=1.0
; multiplier for acrobatics running forward jump
JumpAcrobaticsMultiplier=1.0
; multiplier for standing vertical jump up
JumpVerticalMultiplier=1.0
; multiplier for jump height (vertical impulse)
JumpHeightMultiplier=1.0
; built-in fps fix for jump distance (4 cases with Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps):
;   0 + Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps absent  -> vanilla fps-dependent jump base + multipliers
;   1 + Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps absent  -> zJumpDistance applies fps fix + multipliers
;   0 + Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps present -> Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps applies fps fix + zJumpDistance applies multipliers
;   1 + Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps present -> Union_JumpAcrobaticsNoFps applies fps fix (no double fix) + zJumpDistance applies multipliers
FixFpsJump=1
[/code]

